[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_xscp0")
fish_name = "Your/Name Remora"
grade = 2
sprite = ExtResource("2_j8gu6")
catch_blurb = "You WISH you were this fish!"
description = "The Your/Name Remora is a subject of intense frustration for the scientific community. Many attempts to publish journals on its fascinating behavior and assign it a more proper name have been completely stunted by its never-ending popularity among pubescent populations. Instead of scientific facts, “data” on the Your/Name Remora instead looks like this:

“‘But, who will go to the school festival with me?!’ asked the CEO Shark.
‘I’ll go with you!’ chimes Aurelia, whose scales reflect the sunlight into shades of orange and pink.
‘Ugh, I guess I’ll go with you,’ adds Swimdere.
CEO Fish can hardly decide who to go with! The bubbly Aurelia, or the teasing Swimdere...he feels more weight on his heart than there is cash in his father’s parent company. Until suddenly, the most beautiful fish swims by.
‘Who’s that?’ the CEO Shark asks.
‘Her?’ Swimdere scoffs, ‘That’s...Your/Name.’”

Many mammalian organisms covet the luscious hair of the Your/Name Remora, and excerpts like the one above do zero favors for snapping its admirers back to reality. Lifeforms of all kinds are endlessly envious of them, yet also insist that they are “literally this fish.” Unfortunately, the scientific journal on this fish’s morning routine is lost to time.
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cr3nmjdvpgh0a"
